    "designFreedom": "Reward useful changes to food and plate forms, proportions, construction and edible detail. Original part counts, source contour minutiae and awkward forms are not aesthetic constraints; preserve role, palette family and locked registration/contact contract.",
    "visibleSuccessCriteria": [
      {
        "id": "salmon-identity",
